        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-09T23:28:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><span class=\"bbcode-u\"><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Omnitron-X</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">HP:</span> 22</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Hand:</span> Electro-Deployment Unit, Reactive Plating Subroutine, Rocket Punch, Elemental Exochassis, Innervation Ray</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">In play:</span> Electro-Deployment Unit</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Trash:</span> Self Sabotage</p>\n<p>[hr]<br>\n<span class=\"bbcode-b\">Start of hero turn:</span> EDU <span class=\"hashtag\">#1:</span> Put Electro-Deployment Unit into play. EDU <span class=\"hashtag\">#2:</span> Put Innervation Ray into play. Innervation Ray: Restore 1HP to Cryo Bot (4), Golem Unity (22), and Scholar (23). Scholar deals 1 damage to Grand Warlord Voss (86).</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Play a card:</span> <span class=\"bbcode-i\">Elemental Exochassis</span>.</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Use a power:</span> <span class=\"bbcode-i\">Timeshift</span> on myself, revealing <span class=\"bbcode-i\">Reset</span>. Put it into play. Shuffle trash into deck, draw <span class=\"bbcode-i\">Slip Through Time</span> and play it.</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Draw a card:</span> Defensive Blast</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">End of hero turn:</span> Slip through Time: Play <span class=\"bbcode-i\">Rocket Punch</span>. Deal Grand Warlord Voss 2 projectile damage then 1 projectile damage (83).</p>\n<p>[hr]</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">HP:</span> 22</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Hand:</span> Reactive Plating Subroutine, Defensive Blast</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">In play:</span> Electro-Deployment Unit (Component) (x2), Innervation Ray (Component), Elemental Exochassis, Slip through Time, Rocket Punch</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Trash:</span> Reset</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Additional effects:</span> Fire, cold, lightning, or energy damage to Omnitron-X is reduced by 2. If Omnitron-X is dealt more than 5 damage in a turn, all components are destroyed. Various other effects on O-X’s turn.</p>\n<p>[hr]</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">HP status:</span> Voss - 83, Young Legacy - 25, Scholar - 23, Ra - 28, Omnitron-X - 22, Golem Unity - 22, Cryo Bot - 4, F.I.L.T.E.R. Spy - 5</p>",
