        "created_at": "2013-11-10T00:01:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><span><span>Golem Unity</span></span></p><p><span>HP:</span>&nbsp;22</p><p><span>Hand:</span>&nbsp;Raptor Bot, Turret Bot, Brainstorm x2</p><p><span>In play: Cryo Bot - 4</span></p><p><span>Trash: Powered Shockwave,</span><span>&nbsp;Inspired Repair</span></p><p><span>Additional effects:&nbsp;</span><span>Whenever Cryo Bot is dealt damage, it deals each non-hero target 1 cold damage.</span></p><hr><p><span>Start of hero turn:</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>Play a card:</span>&nbsp;<i>Brainstorm; </i>1 damage to the FILTER Spy [4], draw Champion Bot, Swift Bot.</p><p><span>Use a power:</span>&nbsp;<span>Golem-Spawn</span>. Deal myself 4 energy damage [17]. Put Swift Bot into play.</p><p><span>Draw a card:</span>&nbsp;Supply Crate, Platform Bot</p><p><span>End of hero turn:</span></p><hr><p><span>HP:</span>&nbsp;18</p><p><span>Hand:</span>&nbsp;Raptor Bot, Turret Bot, Brainstorm, Champion Bot, Supply Crate, Platform Bot</p><p><span>In play:</span>&nbsp;Cryo Bot - 4, Swift Bot - 6</p><p><span>Trash:</span>&nbsp;Powered Shock Wave, Inspired Repair, Brainstorm</p><p><span>Additional effects:</span>&nbsp;Whenever Cryo Bot is dealt damage, it deals each non-hero target 1 cold damage.</p><p>Unity may draw an extra card during her draw phase and play an extra card during her play phase.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>HP status:</span><span>&nbsp;Voss - 83, Young Legacy - 25, Scholar - 23, Ra - 28, Omnitron-X - 22, Golem Unity - 18, Cryo Bot - 4, Swift Bot - 6, F.I.L.T.E.R. Spy - 4</span></p>",
