        "cooked": "<p><span class=\"bbcode-u\"><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Time Cataclysm</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Start of environment turn:</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Play a card:</span> Surprise Shopping Trip</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">End of environment turn:</span> F.I.L.T.E.R. Spy deals Ra 4 toxic damage (24). Ra deals F.I.L.T.E.R. Spy 3 fire damage (1).</p>\n<p>[hr]</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">In play:</span> F.I.L.T.E.R. Spy (4hp), Surprise Shopping Trip</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Trash:</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Additional effects:</span> ET: F.I.L.T.E.R. Spy deals the non-agent target with the second-highest HP 4 toxic damage. Whenever a card enters play, deal each target 1 melee damage. ST: destroy this card.</p>\n<p>[hr]</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">HP status:</span> Voss - 83, Young Legacy - 25, Scholar - 23, Ra - 24, Omnitron-X - 22, Golem Unity - 18, Cryo Bot - 4, Swift Bot - 6, F.I.L.T.E.R. Spy - 1</p>",
