      {
        "id": 81127,
        "name": "dpt",
        "username": "dpt",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-10T06:42:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\"><span class=\"bbcode-u\"><font size=\"18\">Round Three</font></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\"><span class=\"bbcode-u\">Grand Warlord Voss - Conquering Alien Warlord</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">HP:</span> 83</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">In Play:</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Trash:</span> Gene-Bound Bionaut, Gene-Bound Firesworn, Gene-Bound Soldier, Gene-Bound Banshee, Gene-Bound Ion Lancer, Gene-Bound Firesworn</p>\n<p>[hr]<br>\n<span class=\"bbcode-b\">Start of Turn:</span> Voss flips to his Super-Thorathian Warrior side.</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Play a Card:</span> Quark-Drive Translocator (10 hp). <span class=\"bbcode-i\">Suprise Shopping Trip</span> deals 1 melee damage to Voss (82), YL (24), Scholar (22), Ra (23), O-X (21), Unity (17), Swift Bot (5), F.I.L.T.E.R. Spy (dead), and Cryo Bot (3). <span class=\"bbcode-i\">Cryo Bot</span> deals Voss 2 cold damage (80).</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">End of Turn:</span> <span class=\"bbcode-i\">Voss</span> deals <span class=\"bbcode-i\">Young Legacy</span> 4 energy damage (20) and <span class=\"bbcode-i\">Cryo Bot</span> 3 fire damage (dead). Play Gene-Bound Frosthound and Gene-Bound Shock Infantry (from Quark-Drive Translocator). <span class=\"bbcode-i\">Surprise Shopping Trip</span> deals another 2 melee damage to YL (18), Scholar (20), Ra (21), O-X (19), Unity (15), and Swift Bot (3).</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-i\">Gene-Bound Frosthound</span> deals 2 cold damage to Ra (19), who retaliates and kills it before it hurts anyone else.</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-i\">Gene-Bound Shock Infantry</span> deals 3 lightning damage to The Scholar (17).</p>\n<p>[hr]<br>\n<span class=\"bbcode-b\">HP:</span> 78</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">In Play:</span> Quark-Drive Translocator - 7<br>\nGene-Bound Shock Infantry - 2</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Trash:</span> Gene-Bound Bionaut, Gene-Bound Firesworn, Gene-Bound Soldier, Gene-Bound Banshee, Gene-Bound Ion Lancer, Gene-Bound Firesworn, Gene-Bound Frosthound</p>\n<p>[hr]<br>\n<span class=\"bbcode-b\">Hero HP:</span> Young Legacy - 18, Scholar - 17, Ra - 19, Omnitron-X - 19, Golem Unity - 15, Swift Bot - 1</p>\n<p>EDIT: Translocator is at 7HP, Shock Infantry at 2, Voss at 80. No damage to Voss at end of turn due to his DR.</p>",
