        "created_at": "2013-11-10T13:06:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Voss should be at 77 after your turn, I think? EDIT: Wow, this is confusing. I think Voss is still at 80, because he has DR when minions are out.</p><p>And I guess the Surprise Shopping Trip damage happens before the Interception takes effect, or would that fall under the new ruling? Note the wording: it deals damage when the card \"enters play\".</p><p>We also now have net +1 damage, so I think Legacy deals herself 4 damage.</p>",
