        "created_at": "2013-11-10T16:52:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’m starting with the following HP totals: Voss - 80, QDT - 2, Shock Infantry - 1, Legacy - 12, Scholar - 16, Ra - 18, OX - 18, Unity - 14, Swift Bot - DEAD</p>\n<p>(Extra damage to Voss, maybe from Cryo Bot, QDT and Legacy from the +1 from Inspiring Presence, and Shock Infantry from the last Shopping Trip during Voss’ turn. I’m going with the Shopping Trip damage happening before the Interception works.)<br>\n<span class=\"bbcode-u\"><span class=\"bbcode-b\">The Scholar</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">HP:</span> 16</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Hand:</span> Keep Moving, Solid to Liquid, Mortal Form to Energy, “Get Out of the Way!” (x2), Grace under Fire, Don’t Dismiss Anything, Offensive Transmutation, Know when to Hold Fast, Know when to Turn Loose, Expect the Worst</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">In play:</span> Bring What You Need, Mortal Form to Energy</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Trash:</span> Keep Moving</p>\n<p>[hr]<br>\n<span class=\"bbcode-b\">Start of hero turn:</span> Discard Know When to Turn Loose for maintenance.</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Play a card:</span> <span class=\"bbcode-i\">Offensive Transmutation</span>. SST deals 1 damage to Shock Infantry (DEAD), QDT (1), Voss (79), and Legacy (11). Deal 2+1 infernal damage to Voss (76). Voss cannot deal damage until the start of my next turn.</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Use a power:</span> <span class=\"bbcode-i\">Bring What You Need</span>. “Get Out of the Way!” and Transmutive Recovery to hand, Mortal Form to Energy to the bottom of the deck.</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Draw a card:</span> Alchemical Redirection</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">End of hero turn:</span></p>\n<p>[hr]</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">HP:</span> 16</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Hand:</span> Keep Moving, Solid to Liquid, Mortal Form to Energy, “Get Out of the Way!” (x3), Grace under Fire, Don’t Dismiss Anything, Offensive Transmutation, Know when to Hold Fast, Expect the Worst, Transmutive Recovery, Alchemical Redirection</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">In play:</span> Bring What You Need, Mortal Form to Energy</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Trash:</span> Keep Moving, Know when to Turn Loose</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Bottom of Deck:</span> Mortal Form to Energy</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Additional effects:</span> Voss cannot deal damage until the start of Scholar’s next turn.</p>\n<p>[hr]<br>\n<span class=\"bbcode-b\">HP status:</span> Voss - 76, QDT - 1, Legacy - 11, Scholar - 16, Ra - 18, OX - 18, Unity - 14</p>",
