        "cooked": "<p><span class=\"bbcode-u\"><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Golem Unity</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">HP:</span> 15</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Hand:</span> Raptor Bot, Turret Bot, Champion Bot, Platform Bot, Brainstorm, Supply Crate</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">In play:</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Trash:</span> Powered Shock Wave, Inspired Repair, Brainstorm, Cryo Bot, Swift Bot</p>\n<p>[hr]<br>\n<span class=\"bbcode-b\">Start of hero turn:</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Play a card:</span> <span class=\"bbcode-i\">Supply Crate</span>. Draw Platform Bot.</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Use a power:</span> <span class=\"bbcode-i\">Golem-Spawn</span>. Take no damage (thanks, Legs!) Put <span class=\"bbcode-i\">Turret Bot</span> into play.</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Draw a card:</span> Construction Pylon (phew!)</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">End of hero turn:</span></p>\n<p>[hr]</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">HP:</span> 15</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Hand:</span> Raptor Bot, Champion Bot, Platform Bot (x2), Brainstorm, Supply Crate, Construction Pylon</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">In play:</span> Turret Bot - 9</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Trash:</span> Powered Shock Wave, Inspired Repair, Brainstorm, Cryo Bot, Swift Bot</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\">Additional effects:</span> ST: Turret Bot goes “Budda budda budda!” (3 projectile damage)</p>",
